{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":28.110000610351562,"text":"A ribbon of marble about 160 meters long ran around the inside of the temple, showing a procession, horses dancing on the spot, young men carrying jars, girls with offerings, old men in conversation. It is thought to show the Panathenaic festival, when the whole city walked up the rock. The striking thing is that it does not show only gods and heroes, it shows the Athenians themselves, which was rare on a temple.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.41999998688697815},{"word":"ribbon","start":0.41999998688697815,"end":0.5600000023841858},{"word":"of","start":0.5600000023841858,"end":1.2000000476837158},{"word":"marble","start":1.2000000476837158,"end":1.2000000476837158},{"word":"about","start":1.2000000476837158,"end":1.5399999618530273},{"word":"160","start":1.5399999618530273,"end":2.4200000762939453},{"word":"meters","start":2.4200000762939453,"end":2.7799999713897705},{"word":"long","start":2.7799999713897705,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"ran","start":3.200000047683716,"end":3.5799999237060547},{"word":"around","start":3.5799999237060547,"end":3.880000114440918},{"word":"the","start":3.880000114440918,"end":4.320000171661377},{"word":"inside","start":4.320000171661377,"end":4.519999980926514},{"word":"of","start":4.519999980926514,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"the","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"temple","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"showing","start":5.800000190734863,"end":5.800000190734863},{"word":"a","start":5.800000190734863,"end":6.179999828338623},{"word":"procession","start":6.179999828338623,"end":6.559999942779541},{"word":"horses","start":7.5,"end":7.5},{"word":"dancing","start":7.5,"end":7.920000076293945},{"word":"on","start":7.920000076293945,"end":8.15999984741211},{"word":"the","start":8.15999984741211,"end":8.300000190734863},{"word":"spot","start":8.300000190734863,"end":8.539999961853027},{"word"